config KDLOCK_REBUILD
	bool "kdlock private mutex core for source rebuild"
	depends on X86_64 && !PREEMPT_RT
	help
	  Package the private ordinary-mutex core into the kernel. The selected
	  Linux 7.0 task_struct field must already be integrated. This option
	  supplies no mutex aliases, task provisioning or lifecycle hooks, source
	  provider, executable-image transport or additional API/context lane.

	  Enabling this option establishes no build, execution or performance
	  evidence. See kernel/integration/BUILDING.md in the kdlock package.
